            "title": "蜜雪擬回購2.52%H股  以現市值計涉約6億元",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">蜜雪集團(02097)公布，擬不時於公開市場回購H股，總數不超過379.62萬股，佔本公告日期本公<br/>  司已發行H股總數的約2.52%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"蜜雪冰城官網圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/800x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/06/b56bd25a2e9ab68fcafb959591dd06a0.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"蜜雪冰城官網圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/800x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/06/b56bd25a2e9ab68fcafb959591dd06a0.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">蜜雪冰城官網圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">以蜜雪集團中午收市價162.5元計算，回購涉資約6.17億元。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">集團稱，將在市場回購H股，及向本公司H股獎勵計劃項下的受託人提供資金以購入H股。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17273718-%e8%9c%9c%e9%9b%aa%e6%93%ac%e5%9b%9e%e8%b3%bc2-52h%e8%82%a1-%e4%bb%a5%e7%8f%be%e5%b8%82%e5%80%bc%e8%a8%88%e6%b6%89%e7%b4%846%e5%84%84%e5%85%83",
